<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">Josua</book>
  <para style="h">Josua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Josua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Josua</para>
  <para style="mt">Josua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia thih hnuin Mosia puitu, Nuna fapa, Josua hnênah Lalpa chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh Mosia chu a thi ta a, Israel mi zawng zawng hi Jordan lui kânpui rawh, ka pêk tûr rama kal tûrin inpuahchah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosia hnêna ka hrilh tawh ang khân in kephaha in rah apiang, nangni, ka mite hi ka pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhim lam thlalêr aṭanga hmâr lam Lebanon tlâng chhak lam Eufretis luipui aṭanga khawthlang lam Hit mite ram, Mediteranean tuipui thlengin in ram a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Josua, i dam chhûngin, tu man an chelh lo vang che. Mosia hnêna ka awm ang khân i hnênah pawh ka awm reng ang a, ka awmpui reng ang chia, ka thlahthlam tawp lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai takin ṭan la rawh; tichuan, an thlahtute hnêna pêk ka tiam tawh ram chu i luahpui dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai takin ṭan la vak phawt mai rawh; Mosian ka dân a hrilh che kha zâwm vek la, pakhat tê mah ngaihthah suh; tichuan, kawng engkimah i hmuingîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eng lai mahin ka dân bu chhûnga thu ziakte chu chhiar theihnghilh suh, i zawm vek theih nân a chhûn a zânin sawi ṭhîn ang che; tichuan, kawng engkimah i tluang ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai takin ṭang rawh ka tih che kha hre reng rawh, hlau suh la, zâm hek suh; kei, Lalpa hian i kalna apiangah ka awmpui zêl che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Josua chuan Israel-ho hruaitute hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Riahhmunah kal vek ula, mite hnênah, ‘Ni thum chhûngin, Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk che u ram luah tûrin Jordan lui in kai dâwn a, ei tûrte buatsaih rawh u’ ti ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te leh Manase-ho zâtve te hnênah Josua chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosian in hnênah hetiangin a sawi a nih kha hre reng rawh u, ‘In Pathian, Lalpa chuan Jordan lui chhak lamah in ram chanpual tûr a pe ve ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />in nupui te, in fanau te, in ran vulh te chu he laiah hian an lo awm ang a, in zînga râlthuam kengte hi chuan lui in lo kai hmasa ang a, in unau Israel-te hi in pui tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin a pêk tûr che u ram, Jordan lui khawthlang lam chu an luah fel a, Israel hnamten an awmna tûr ṭheuhva him taka an awm hunah chauh in kîr thei ang a, Jordan chhak lam ram, Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosian a pêk che u-ah hian in awm thei ang,’ a tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josua chu an chhâng a, “Min hrilh apiang kan ti ang e, kal rawh u i tihna apiangah kan kal zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mosia thu kan awih ṭhîn ang khân i thu pawh kan awih ang; Lalpa i Pathian chuan Mosia a awmpui ṭhîn ang khân awmpui zêl che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I thu kalha, i thupêk zâwm duh lo chu tihlum mai ang che. Huai takin ṭan la sauh sauh phawt mai teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nuna fapa Josua chuan Sitim ruam aṭang chuan enthlatu tûr mi pahnih a tîr a, “Ram chu a rûkin va en thlithlai teh u, Jeriko khua phei chu en chiang zual ang che u,” a ti a. Khua an va thlen chuan riah tumin nawhchizuar Rahabi in an pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeriko lal chuan, Israel-te tirh enthlatute chu chumi zân chuan an lo thleng tih a lo hriatin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rahabi hnênah, “I ina lo thlengte kha ram en thlithlai tûra lo kal an ni, han hruai rawh,” ti tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu nu chuan mikhual pahnihte chu a hruai a, a thukru a, “Mi pahnih chu an lo thleng ngei mai a, khawi lam mi nge an nih ka hre hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khaw thim dâwn ṭêp, kulh kawngka khâr hma chiah khân an chhuak leh ta a nih kha: khawi lamah nge an kal dâwn ka hre miah lo; ûm thuai ula, in la ûm pha hman ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu mite chu in chungah a hruai a, ziza kuang a pho zîngah chuan a thukru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal mi tirhte chu Israel-te ûm tûr chuan an tlân chhuak a, kulh kawngkapui chu an khâr leh a, Jordan lui thlengin an ûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An mut hmain Rahabi chu in chungah a chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan ram hi a pe tawh che u tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng lai mite hi hlau lo che u tu mah an awm lo, an zâm zo ta. Aigupta ram in chhuahsan a, Lalpa chuan in hmaa Tuipui Sen a tihchah thu te kan lo hria a, Jordan chhak lama Amor lal Sihona leh Oga in thah dânte pawh kan lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûng chu kan hriatin kan zâm chhia a, nangmahni hlauvin mu leh mal pawh kan nei tawh lo; in Pathian, Lalpa hi lei leh vâna rorêltu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tih ṭhat che u ang bawkin kan chhûnga min ti ṭha ve tûrin in Pathian hming chhâlin thu tiam ula, chumi hriatna tûr chuan chhinchhiahna min pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pa te, ka nu te, ka nuṭate leh ka laizâwn te, an chhûngkuain zuah ang che u, min that lo tûrin thu tiam rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan, “Min hum chuan kan hum ngei ang che; kan lo kal dân hi tu mah i hrilh loh chuan, ram hi Lalpan min pêk hunah, ṭha takin kan ti ang che u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khaw kulh bang ringa in nei a ni a, tukverh aṭang chuan anni chu hruizênin a thlâk thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tlâng lamah in kal loh chuan ûmtuten an hmu mai ang che u, ni thum biru ula, a rawn ûmtu che u an lo kîr hunah in duh duhnaah in kal dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mite chuan, “I tih ang chuan thu kan tiam ang a, hetianga i tih ve loh erawh chuan a mawh kan phur lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He ram kan lo thlen hunah he la sen hi min thlâkna tukverhah ṭâwn bet ang che. I pa te, i nu te, i nuṭate leh i pa chhûngte i inah hian ko khâwm la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khawlaiah tu mah chhuak suh se; chhuak an awm chuan an thisen mawh chu anmahniin an phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan thu hi tu mah i hrilh tûr a ni lo, i hrilh vaih chuan keini pawhin thu min tiamtîr ang hian kan ti bîk lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ani chuan, “In thu ang chuan ni rawh se,” a ti a. A kaltîr a, an chhuak ta a. La sen chu tukverhah chuan a ṭâwn bet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tlâng lamah chuan an kal a, ni thum an biru a. Ûmtute chuan an rawn zawng haw zêl a; mahse, an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu mite pahnih chu tlâng lam ata an lo chhuak a, lui an kân a, Josua hnên an lo thleng a, an thil tawh zawng zawng chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Josua hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan ram chu min pe ngei a lo ni, kan thâwmah mi an zâm chhe zo vek mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tûkah Josua hovin Israel-te chu zîng takah an tho va, Sitim zâwl aṭang chuan lui bulah an insawn a, lui an kân hmain an riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi tûk tûk lehah chuan hotute chuan bûk chu an fang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm chu puithiamten an zâwn in hmuh hunah intêl fel ula, in zui nghâl dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In kalna ngai lohva kal tûr in ni a, an hnung in zui zêl dâwn nia; amaherawhchu, Thuthlung Bâwm hnaih lutuk suh ang che u, tawng sânghnih vêl in inkârah tla rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Josua chuan mipui hnênah, “Inthian thianghlim rawh u, naktûk hian Lalpa chuan kan zîngah thil mak tak a ti dâwn e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josua chuan puithiamho hnênah, “Thuthlung Bâwm chu zâwn ula, kal hmasa rawh u le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah, “Vawiin hian Israel-te hmuhah ka chawimawi dâwn che a ni, Mosia hnêna ka awm ang khân i hnênah pawh ka awm ṭhîn dâwn tih an hre dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiamte chu Jordan lui kamah tui daia ding tûrin hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josua chuan Israel mite hnênah, “Lo kal ula, Lalpa in Pathian thu hi ngaithla teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Josua chuan, “Pathian nung chu in zîngah a awm tih leh Kanan mite leh Jebus mite chu in hmaah a hnawt chhuak ngei dâwn tih hetiang hian in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jordan luiah in hma hruaiin khawvêl zawng zawng Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm chu a kal hmasa ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi sâwm leh pahnih, Israel hnam tina mi pakhat ṭheuh thlang chhuak ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khawvêl zawng zawng Lalpa Thuthlung Bawm zâwntu puithiamte ke-in Jordan lui a dai vêleh, Jordan lui tui luang chu a chat ang a, chhak lam aṭanga lo luang zawng zawng chu a tling khâwm vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipui chu Jordan kai tum chuan an puan in aṭang chuan an chhuak a; Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntu puithiamte chu an kal hmasa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutih lai chu buh seng hun, Jordan lui len lai a ni a, a kuang a liam hial a. Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntuten Jordan lui an han dai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chhak lam aṭanga tui lo luang chu a chat a, a hnâr lamah Zarethan bul Adam khawpui thlengin a tling khâwm a. Araba lam Tuipui Thi a luang lût ṭhîn chu a kang chat ta vek a; Jeriko khaw bul maiah mipui chuan lui chu an kal kai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel mite chu an zavaiin lei chârah Jordan lui chu an kal kai a; Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntute chu li laiah chuan leichârah mipui kai zawh hma chu an ding a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnam puma Jordan lui an kai zawh vek hnu chuan Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel hnam tin zînga in thlan chhuah mi sâwm leh pahnihte khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jordan luia puithiamte dinna aṭangin lung sâwm leh pahnih, pakhat ṭheuhvin, pu chhuak sela, zânina in riahna tûrah dah teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josua chuan hnam tin aṭanga Israel miten an thlan chhuah mi sâwm leh pahnihte chu a ko va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />an hnênah, “ Lalpa in Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm chu kal pêl ula, lung pakhat ṭheuh, a vaiin Israel hnam zât, Jordan lui lai aṭangin pu ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chûng lung chu Lalpa thiltih hriat reng nân a ni ang. Nakin hnuah in faten, ‘Hêng lungte hi engtihna nge’ an tih hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘ Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwmin Jordan lui a kai dâwn khân Jordan lui luang chu a chat a, kumkhuaa chumi hriatrengna tûr a nih hi,’ in la ti dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josua thu ang chuan Israel-te chuan an ti a, Jordan lui ata lung sâwm leh pahnih, Josua hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang khân, an pu chhuak a; Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih zât chu an riahna tûrah chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josua chuan Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntute dinnaah tak, Jordan luiah chuan, lung a dahtîr bawk a, tûn thlengin chûng chu a la awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bâwm zâwntu puithiamte chu luiah chuan an ding a, mipui chu an kal kai sawk sawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An kai vek hnu chuan Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntu puithiamte chu mipui hmaah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te leh Manase-ho zâtve te chuan hriamhrei kengin, Mosia hnêna thupêk ang khân, mipui hma an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa hmaa indo peih reng mi sîngli laiin Jeriko bul zâwl an va thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Israel zawng zawng hmuhah Lalpa chuan Josua chu a chawimawi a, a dam chhûng chu Mosia ang bawkin an ngaisâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntu puithiamte kha Jordan lui ata lo chhuak rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Josuan puithiamho hnênah, “Jordan lui ata kha lo chhuak rawh u le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntute Jordan lui ata an lo chhuaha, lui kam lei an rah veleh Jordan tui chu a luang leh ta dûl dûl a, a hma ang khân a kuang a liam hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jordan lui chu thla khatna ni sâwm ni-in an kal kai a ni. Jeriko chhak lam ramri bul Gilgal-ah bûk an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jordan lui aṭanga an lung lâk chu Josua chuan Gilgal-ah chuan a phun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mite hnênah chuan, “Nakin hnuah in faten an pate hnênah, ‘hêng lung hi engtihna nge?’ tia an zawh che u hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘He laiah hian Israel-ten leichârah lui an kal kai a ni,’ in ti dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuipui Sen kân hmaa tuipui tui a tichat ang bawk khân Lalpa chuan Jordan lui kan kai vek hma chu lui tui luang a tichat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hêng avâng hian khawvêla hnam tinin Lalpa thiltihtheihzia an hria ang a, kumkhuain in Pathian, Lalpa hi in chawimawi dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan lui thlang lama awm, Amor lal zawng zawng leh Mediteranean kama Kanan lal awm zawng zawngin Israel-ten Jordan an kân chhûng zawng lui tui chu a tihchahsak tih an lo hriat chuan an zâm chhe zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Lalpan Josua hnênah, “Meilung hriam siam la, Israel mi serh la tan lohho serh tansak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josua chuan meilung hriam a siam a, Israel-te chu Gibeat-haaralot-ah an serh a tantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga râlkai chin lo chhuak zawng zawng chu thlalêrah an thi vek tawh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />an chhuah tirh khân serh an tan vek a ni; an lo kal chhûnga piangte erawh chu an serh la tan loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mite chu thlalêrah kum sawmli an vâkvai a, Aigupta ram ata an chhuah aṭanga râlkai tawh chin chu an thi hman vek a ni. Lalpa thu an ngaihthlâk loh chuan khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ram pêk a tiam chu an thleng ve lo vang tia a sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An aiah, an fate a tipuitling a, chûng mite chu a ni Josuan serh a tansakte chu; kawngah an serh an la tan lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng serh an tan hnu chuan an dam hma chu bûkah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah, “Vawiin hian Aigupta miten an hmuhsitna che u kha ka nuai bo ta e,” a ti a. Chumi hmun chu tûn thlengin Gilgal an ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gilgal-ah chuan Israel-ten bûk an khuar a, Jeriko phaizâwlah chuan chumi thla, ni sâwm leh pali ni chuan Kalhlên kût an hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kalhlên kût zawh tûkah chuan, chu rama thar barli chhangphut, dawidim telh loh chhang leh chhangpêr an ei ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu ram buh an ei tûk aṭang chuan mana pawh a tla ta lo va. Israel-te chuan mana ei tûr an nei ta lo va, chumi kum aṭang chuan Kanan ram buhbâl thar an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jeriko bul lawka a awm laiin Josua chuan a han en a, mi pakhat, khandaih keng hi a hmaah a lo ding reng a, a han hnaih a, “Kan sipai nge i nih a, hmêlma sipai?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“A khawia mah ka ni lo, Lalpa sipaite ho tûra lo kal ka nih hi,” a ti a. Josua chu lei siin a kûn a, “I chhiahhlawh hnênah eng nge sawi i duh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa sipai hotu chuan Josua hnênah, “I pheikhawk kha phelh rawh, i dinna kha hmun thianghlim asin,” a ti a, Josua chuan a phelh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te luh theih loh tûrin Jeriko kulh chu a inkhâr tlat a; tu mah an chhuak thei lo va, an lût thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah, “Jeriko khua chu an lal leh a sipai huaite nên ka pe tawh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khua chu hual la, ni tin vawi khat, râlkai chin chuan kal hual ṭhîn rawh se; chutiangin ni ruk in ti ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a ni sarih ni chuan puithiam pasarihin berâmpa ki tawtawrâwt kengin Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntute hma an hruai ang a, berâm ki chu an hâm ang a, vawi sarih in kal hual tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt chu fân ruaiin an hâm ang a, chu chu in hriat veleh theihtâwp chhuahin mi zawng zawng au dur dur ula; kulh chu a chim rup mai ang; mahni hma zâwn ṭheuhvah in tlân lût mai thei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nuna fapa Josua chuan puithiamho chu a ko va, “ Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm chu zâwn ula, tawtawrâwt keng ṭhiau puithiam pasarihin hma hruai sela, zui ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipui hnênah, “Kal ula, khua chu kal hual rawh u, Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm hmaah râlthuam keng kal hmasa rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josuan mipui hnêna thu a sawi zawh chuan, a tih ang chuan an ti a; tawtawrâwt keng puithiam pasarih chuan tawtawrâwt chu an hâm a; Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntute chuan an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt hâmho puithiam hmaah râlthuam keng an kal a, Thuthlung Bâwm hnungah râlthuam kengten hnung an dâl a. Tawtawrâwt chu chhum lo chat lovin an hâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Josua chuan mipui hnênah, “Au rawh u’ ka tih hunah theihtâwpin in au dâwn nia, chumi hma chuan au tûr a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm zâwn chung chuan khua chu vawi khat an kal hual a, bûkah an kîr leh a, zân an riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tûkah Josua chu zîng takah a tho va, puithiamho chuan bâwm chu an zâwn leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Râlthuam kengin hma an hruai a, puithiam pasarih, tawtawrâwt kengin an zui a, tawtawrâwt chu chhum lo chat lovin an hâm a; Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntute chu râlthuam kengin an rawn chhawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni hnihnaah pawh khua chu vawi khat an kal hual a, bûk lamah an haw leh a. Chutiang hlîr chuan ni ruk an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ni sarih ni erawh chuan kâwl ênah an tho va, an tih dân pângngaiin khua chu an kal hual leh a; chumi ni erawh chuan vawi sarih an kal hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An kal hual vawi sarihnaah chuan Josuan, “Au rawh u le, Lalpa chuan khua hi a pe ta che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a khaw pum leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng te hi tihchhiat tûra Lalpa tâna serh hran vek a ni. Kan mi tirhte lo humtunu avângin Rahabi leh a ina mi awm zawng zawng erawh chu zuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Serh hran tlat tawh chu in awt palh ang e, pakhat tê pawh in la tûr a ni lo, in lâk chuan Israel-ho bûkah chhiatna râpthlâk tak in tithleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tangkarua te, rangkachak te, dâr te leh thîr te erawh chu Lalpa sum bâwmah dah ṭhat tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiamte chuan tawtawrâwt chu fân ruaiin an han hâm a, miten chu chu an hriatin an au chiam a, kulh bang chu a chim ta a; mahni hma zâwn zâwnah an lût ta sung sung a, khua chu an la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khua chu an tichhe vek a, a chhûnga awm a hmei a pa, a pui a pang, bâwng te, berâm te, sabengtung te nên khandaihin an sât hlum vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ram enthlatute hnênah, Josua chuan, “Nawhchizuar inah kal ula, kha nu kha a neih zawng zawng nên va hruai chhuak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Enthlatu tlangvâl, a ina thlengte khân Rahabi chu a pa te, a nuṭa te leh a laichîn hnai a awmpui te chu a neih zawng zawng nên an hruai chhuak a, Israel riahhmunah chuan an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khua leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu an hâl vek a; tangkarua te, rangkachak te, darbêl te, thîr te erawh chu Lalpa ina sum bâwmah an dah ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jeriko enthla tûra Josua mi tirhte a lo hum avângin nawhchizuar Rahabi chu a pa chhûngte nên, a neih zawng zawng nên Josua chuan a zuah a, Israel zîngah tûn thlengin an la tel ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chûng zawh chuan Josuan mipui chu a vau ta a: “Jeriko khaw din leh tumtu chuan Lalpa ânchhia dawng rawh se, A lungphûm rem lehtu chuan a fa tîr chân sela, A kulh kawngka siamtu chuan a fa tlum chân rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua chu a awmpui a, ram pumah a hming a thang ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te chuan thil serh hran tlat chu an pawisa lo va; Juda thlah Zera fa, Karmia fapa Akana chuan thil serh tlat ṭhenkhat chu a lo la a, Israel-te chungah Lalpa chu a thinur ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bethel chhak lam Beth-aven bula awm Ai khua en thlithlai tûrin Josua chuan Jeriko aṭangin mi a tîr a. Anni chu an chho va, Ai chu an han en thlithlai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An lo haw a, Josua hnênah, “Mi zawng zawng chho teh suh se, mi sânghnih sângthum vêl chauh chho sela, Ai chu han bei rawh se, an tlêm khawp mai; mi zawng zawng tihhah a ṭûl lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi sângthum vêl chuan an han bei a, Ai khaw mite hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ai khaw mite chuan kulh aṭangin Sebarim thleng rawkin an ûm a, an tlân chhuk chu mi sawmthum leh paruk lai an that a. Israel-ho rilru chu a hnual a, an zâm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josua leh Israel upate chuan an puan an pawtthlêr a, Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm hmaah chuan an bawkkhup a, an lu-ah vaivut an phul a, tlai thlengin an bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josua chuan, “A va pawî em, Lalpa Pathian, Amor mite sawisak tûr leh tihral mai tûrin engah kher nge Jordan lui min kal kaitîr teh rêng le? Jordan chhak lama awm kha lo lungawi tâwk mai ila a ṭha tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Israel-te chu an hmêlmaten an ûm ta mai si a, ṭawngna tûr pawh kan neih tâk loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kanan mite leh hêng rama awmten an hriatin min hual ang a, min that vek ang a, a mite pawh a hum zo lo an ti ngei ang che le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah, “Tho teh, bawk reng teh suh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel-ten thil sual an ti alâwm. Ka thuthlung zâwm tûra ka tih chu an bawhchhia a, thil serh hran tlat aṭangin lâk an nei, an ru a, an zêp a, an thawmhnaw zîngah an thukru lehnghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng alâwm Israel-te hian an hmêlmate an ngam lohva, an tlânchhiat ni; ânchhia an dawng a ni. Lâk loh tûr in lâk kha in tihboral hma chu in hnênah ka awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tho la, mipuite chu thian fai la, an hnênah, naktûkah chuan inthian fai tûrin hrilh rawh. Israel-te Pathian chuan, ‘Israel-te u, in zîngah ânchhia a awm a ni, chu chu in zîng ata in then fai hma chuan in hmêlmate in ngam lo vang,’ a ti e, tiin hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, zîngah a hnam hnamin lo kal sela, Lalpa lo man hnam chu a chi chiin an lo kal leh tûr a ni; Lalpan chi a lo man aṭang chuan chhûngkuain an lo kal ang a, chhûngkua a lo man aṭang chuan, paho an lo kal leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil serh tlat latu man chhuah chu hâl tûr a ni, a neih zawng zawng nên, Lalpa thupêk, lâk loh tûr a tih chu a bawhchhia a, Israel tân thil zahthlâk tak a ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josua chu zîng takah a tho va, a hnam hnamin Israel-ho chu an lo kal a, Juda thlahte chu man an ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda thlah zîngah Zer chi man an ni leh a, Zer-ho zîng aṭang chuan Zabdia chhûng man an ni leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu mi chhûngte zîng aṭang chuan Karmia fapa Akana, Zabdia tupa chu man a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josua chuan Akana hnênah, “Ka fapa, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hmaah thu dik tak sawi rawh aw: Thupha chawi mai teh, eng nge i tih, zêp lovin min hrilh teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Akana chuan Josua chu a chhâng a, “Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa lakah thil sual ka lo ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kan thil man zîngah Babulon puan mawi tak, tangkarua sekel za bûk vêl leh sekel sawmnga vêl bûk rangkachak nên ka hmu a, ka awt êm a, ka la ta mai a ni. Ka puanin chhuatah ka phûm a, a hnuaihnung berah tangkarua chu ka dah kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josua chuan mi a tîr a, puan inah chuan an kal a, a lo thukru ngei rêng a, a hnuai berah tangkarua chu a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Puan in ata chu an la a, Josua leh Israel-te hmaah chuan an rawn la a, Lalpa hmaah chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Josua leh Israel-te chuan Zera fapa Akana chu puan te, tangkarua te, rangkachakte leh a nupui fanau te, a bâwng te, a sabengtung te, a berâm te leh a neih zawng zawng nên Akor ruamah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josua chuan, “Min timangang hle mai a, Lalpa chuan vawiin hian a timangang ve dâwn che a nih hi,” a ti a. Mi zawng zawngin Akana leh a chhûngte chu lungin an dêng a, an neih zawng zawng nên chuan an hâl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A chungah chuan lung an vawm vûm thûr a, Lalpa thinur chu a dai ta a. Vawiin thlengin chu ruam chu Akor ruam tih a la ni ta reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah, “Hlau suh la, beidawng hek suh; Israel-te zînga indo thiam hruai vek la, Ai khua bei tûrin chho rawh. Ai khaw lal te, a mi te, a khawpuite leh a ramte chu i kutah ka pe tawh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An khua leh an lal chu Jeriko khua leh an lal i sawisak ang khân sawisa ang che; tûn ṭum hi chuan an berâm leh an rante chu mahni tân in lâksak dâwn nia. Khaw hnung lam aṭangin bei thut ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ai khua bei tûr chuan Josua leh a hote chu an insiam a. Josua chuan mi fel deuh deuh sîngthum a thlang chhuak a, zânah a kal chhohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Khua chu a hnung lamah châng ru ula, khua aṭanga hla lovah biru ang che u, inring reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mite nên khua chu a hma lamah kan rawn bei ang a, min bei tûrin an lo chhuak ang a; a hma angin kan tlânchhe der ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />khua aṭanga hla fe thleng min ûm hnuah, a hma ang khân kan tlânchhe tak tak emaw an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In bihrûkna ata in lo chhuak ang a, khua chu la ang che u. In Pathian, Lalpa chuan a pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khua in lâk hnu chuan Lalpa thu angin hâl rawh u. In tih tûr chu, chu chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josua chuan anni chu a kaltîr a, Ai khaw thlang lam Bethel nêna an inkârah chuan an hual ru a, zânah Josua ho chu puan inah an riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Josua chu zîngah a tho va, a mite chu a ko khâwm a, Israel upate nên Ai khua chu an pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khaw kawtchhuah, hmâr lam tlângah a hote chuan ṭanhmun an khuar a, Ai khua nêna an inkârah chuan ruam a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ai khawthlang lam, Bethel nêna an inkârah a rûka châng tûr mi sângnga a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sipai bupui chu hmâr lam aṭanga Ai khua bei tûr chuan an inrâlring a, khaw thlang lama lo châng tâwk an awm bawk a. Chumi zân chuan Josua chu ruamah chuan a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ai khaw lal chuan a lo hmu a, a mite nên zîngah an tho va; Israel-ho nêna an inbeihna Araba ruamah khân Israel-ho bei tûr chuan an chhuk leh ta a, an hnung lam aṭangin khawpui bei tûr biru an awm tih an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josua leh Israel-te chu hlau âwm takin thlalêr lam panin an tlânchhe der a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ai khuaa mite chu ûm tûrin an inpun khâwm a, Josua chu an ûm a, khua chu an chhuahsan ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ai khaw mi zawng zawngin Israel-te chu an ûm a, khaw vêngtu pakhat mah an awm lo, khua chu a inhawng huai mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah, “I fei khân Ai khua tin rawh, khua chu ka pe dâwn che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josuan a fei ken chuan Ai khua chu a tin a. Chutia a han tin vêleh chângtute kha an bihrûkna ata an lo zuang chhuak a, khuaah an lût a, an la ta mai a; khua chu an hâl ta hluah hluah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ai khaw mite chu an han lehhawi a, an khaw kâng khu ngun ngun chu an hmu a, thlalêr pana tlânho khân an rawn bei lêt bawk a, tlânna tûr lam rêng an hre ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Josua leh Israel-te chuan châng rutute khân khua chu an la a, an hâl khu ngun ngun ta tih an hmuh chuan an lêt leh a, Ai mite chu an that ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khaw latute khân an rawn ûm bawk a, Israel-te chuan an kârcheh a, tu mah dam emaw, tlân chhuak emaw awm miah lovin an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ai khaw lal erawh chu a nungin an man a, Josua hnênah an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ai khaw mi, Israel ûmtute kha, thlalêrah an lo that vek a, an sah hlum zawh chuan Ai khuaah Israel mi zawng zawng chu an kal a, chuta mi zawng zawng chu khandaihin an that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ai khaw mi, chumi nia an thah chu a hmei a pain mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih an tling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ai khaw mi an thah zawh fai phiar hma chu Josua chuan a fei kha a lek reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Josua hnêna Lalpa thupêk angin ran an mansak te, an râllâk sumte chu mahni tân an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Josua chuan Ai khua chu a hâl chim vek a, tûn thlengin a ram a, bawlhhlawh vûm mai a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ai khaw lal chu a khai hlum a, tlai thlengin thingah a khai a, ni a tlâk chuan Josua thu angin a ruang chu an la thla a, khaw kulh kawngka sîrah chuan an paih a, lung an vawm hnan thûr a, tûn thlengin chûng chu a la awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Josua chuan Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa tân Ebal tlângah maichâm a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosian Israel-te hnêna thu a pêk, Mosia Dân bu-a ziak angin lung chher loh, thîra chher lohvin maichâm an siam a, Lalpa hnênah hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel-ho hmuh lai ngeiin Josua chuan Mosia dân chu lungah chuan a ziak chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel-ho chu an upa te, hruaitu te, rorêltu te leh an zînga hnam dang awm vê te nên puithiam Levia-ho zâwn, Thuthlung Bâwm hawiin, lehlam lehlamah chuan an ding a. A zâtve chuan Gerizim tlâng an hmachhawn a, a zâtve chuan Ebal tlâng chu an hmachhawn a. Israel mipuite mal an sâwmsak dâwnin hetianga din ṭhin tûr tih Mosia thupêk ang khân an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An din fel chuan Dân bu-a thu zawng zawng, malsâwmna thu te, ânchhe dawn tûr thu te chu Josuan a chhiar chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel mipui hmaah, hmeichhia te, naupangte leh an zînga kal ve hnam dang mite hmaah Mosia thupêk zawng zawng chu chhiar hmaih a nei hauh lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan thlang lam tlângrama awm te, tlâng bulṭhut rama awmte leh Mediteranean tuipui kama Lebanon tlâng thlenga awm Hit-ho lal te, Amor lal te, Kanan lal te, Periz lal te, Hiv-ho lal te, Jebus lal te chuan Israel-ho chakzia an lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An inko khâwm a, Josua leh Israel-te chu lo beih rawn zai an rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gibeon khuaa awm Hiv mite chuan Jeriko leh Ai khua Josuan a sawisak dân an hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />finrâwl an thawh ve ta a. Palai ni âwm tak tak an insiam a, ip hlui tak hi sabengtung an phurhtîr a, an uain savun ip, hlui peh ver vurte chu bel ṭup a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />pheikhawk hlui, bel ṭiam ṭuam an bun a, kawr hlui tak tak an ha a. An chhang kente chu a khirin a hmuar uar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel-te riahhmun Gilgal-ah chuan Josua an rawn pan a, a hnênah, “Ram hla tak aṭangin kan lo kal a, inremna thu i thlung ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mite chuan, “He lai hnaia mite in nih chuan thu kan thlunpui thei lo vang che u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josua hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh kan nih hi,” an ti a. Josua chuan, “Tute nge in nih? Khawi lam aṭanga lo kal nge in nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anni chuan, “I chhiahhlawhte hi ram hla tak aṭanga lo kal kan ni. In Pathian, Lalpa chanchin kan lo hria a, Aigupta rama a thil tih hmingthang tak tak te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan râla Amor lal Sihona, Hesbon lal chungah te, Basan lal Astarot khua Oga chunga a thil tih te kan lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan upate leh kan ram mite chuan, ‘Zan riak chaw keng ula, anni chu va hmu ula, in chhiahhlawh kan ni a, thu min thlunpui rawh u, va ti ang che u,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan chhang kente hi kan lo chhuah tûk chuan a la lum thar thar a; tûnah zawng a khirin a hmuar tawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan savun ip tharte pawh a peh zo tawh a, kan thawmhnaw te, kan pheikhawkte pawh kan lo kal thui êm tawh avângin a hniar veng vung tawh a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mite chuan an chhang chu an lo eisak a. Lalpa an râwn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josua chuan ṭhiana inhmang tûrin thu a thlunpui a, tihhlum loh a tiam a, Israel pungkhâwmho hruaitute pawh chuan an tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thu an tiam hnu ni thum lekah chuan chûng mite chu an ṭhenawm, an bul lawka awmte an ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-hote chu ân insawn a, ni thum an kal a; chung mite awmna khua Gibeon te, Kafira te, Kiriat-jearim te chu an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng mite chu Israel mite chuan an khawih thiang lo, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hmingin an hotute chuan thu an lo tiam tlat tawh si a. Pungkhâwmho chuan an hotute chu an dem hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hruaitute chuan pungkhâwmho hnênah, “Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hming chhâlin thu kan lo tiam a, kan khawih a thiang tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan thutiam avângin an nun kan zuah tûr a ni: chutilo chu, Pathian kut kan tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zuah ila, kan thing phurtuah leh tui chawitu-ah an ṭang dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gibeon mite chu Josuan a ko va, “Kan bul hnai maia awm si, ram hla tak aṭanga lo kal kan ni tiin engtizia nge min bum le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hetianga in tih avângin Pathian ânchhia in dawng ta, Pathian ina tuah tûr thing phurtu leh tui chawitu atân chhiahhlawh in ni reng dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Josua chu an chhâng a, “ Lalpa , in Pathian chuan a chhiahhlawh Mosia chu ram pum pui hi pe tûr che uin a ti a, in kalnaa awm apiang that vek tûrin a ti ngei bawk che u a. Chu chu kan lo hria a, kan hlau êm êm che u a, khati khân kan ti ta mai a nih kha, kan hlauh vâng che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In kutah kan awm hi, ṭha in tih ang chuan min ti ang chu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josua chuan hetiang hian a ti ta a: anni chu a hum a, Israel-ten an thah a khap a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />bawihah a siam thung a. Israel mipuite leh Lalpa maichâm tâna thing phurtu leh tui chawitu-ah a dah ta a. Vawiin thleng hian amah an biakna tûr Lalpa hmun ruatah chuan chûng hna chu an thawk ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Jerusalem khaw lal chu Adoni-zedeka a ni a. Josuan Ai khua a lâk a, a tihchhiat vek thu te, Jeriko leh an lal a sawisak ang khân Ai khua leh an lal a sawisa tih thu te a lo hria a; Gibeon mite pawhin Israel-te nên inremna an nei a, an zîngah an tel ve ta tih te an lo hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, Jerusalem mite chuan an hlau hle a; Gibeon khua phei chu lal nei khaw dang tluk bawka tam an ni a. Ai khua ai pawhin an tam, indo pawh an thiam hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem lal Adoni-zedeka chuan Hebron lal Hohama te, Jarmut khaw lal Pirama te, Lakis lal Jafia te, Eglon lal Debira te chu thu a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Lo kal ula, Gibeon-ho hi i bei teh ang, Josua leh Israel-te nên inremna an lo siam reng alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amor-ho lal panga, Jerusalem lal te, Hebron lal te, Jarmut lal te, Lakis lal te, Eglon lal te chu an ṭang rual a, Gibeon khua chu an hual a, an bei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gibeon mite chuan Gilgal-ah Josua hnênah zualko an tlântîr a, “I chhiahhlawhte hi thlahthlam teh suh, lo chho vat la, min han pui rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Josua chu Gilgal aṭang chuan indo mi, mi huaisen rualte chu hruaiin a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah, “Huphurh suh, anni chu ka pe tawh a che; tu mahin an lo dang hauh lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gilgal aṭang chuan zankhuain Gibeon thlengin an kal a. Amor mite chu an bei ta thut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amor mite chuan Israel-te an hmuh chuan Lalpan a tizâm a, Gibeon-ah chuan Israel-te chuan an that chiam a, a ṭhen chu Beth-horon kalkawngah an ûm thla a, chhak lamah Azeka leh Makeda thleng zakin an ûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kalkawnga an tlân laiin Lalpa chuan rial lian pui pui a dentîr a, Azeka thleng rawkin a dêng a. Israel-ho thah ai chuan rial dena thi chu an tam zâwk mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel mite chu Amor-ho a hnehtîr ni chuan Josuan Lalpa chu a bia a, Israel-te hriatah: “Chungtûrni, ding reng rawh, Gibeon chungah Chhawrthlapui, nang pawh Aijalon ruamah ding ve rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni chu a ding a, thla chu a che bawk lo. An hmêlmate an sawisak nek hma chu. ‘Jasar lehkhabu’ an tihah chu thu chu ziak a ni. Vânlaizâwlah ni chu a ding a, ni khat hu lai a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutiang khawpa mihring thu mai Lalpa chuan a zawm ni a la awm ngai lo, awm pawh a awm leh hek lo vang. Lalpa chuan Israel-te chu a dopui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng hnu chuan Josua leh a hote chu an riahhmun Gilgal-ah an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amor lal panga kha an tlânchhia a, Makeda pûkah an biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Josua hnênah, “Lal pangate kha kan hmu ta, Makeda pûkah an biru a ni,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Josua chuan, “Pûk kawngka chu lung lian pui puiin chhîn ula, mi ṭhenkhat vêng tûrin dah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan hmêlmate chu tlân khalh ula, an khaw kulha an tlân lût tûr dang tlat rawh u, Lalpa , in Pathian chuan a hnehtîr che u hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Josua leh Israel-te chuan an hmêlmate chu an that chiam a, an that fai a ni deuh mai, an thah bâng tlêm chu an khaw kulhahte an tlân lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Josua bûk khuarna Makeda-ah chuan a hote chu râlmuang takin an lo kal a; Israel-ho chu hnialkalh ngam rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josua chuan, “Pûk kawngka kha hawng ula, lal pangate kha han hruai chhuak teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jerusalem lal te, Hebron lal te, Jarmut lal te, Lakis lal te leh Eglon lal te chu pûk ata an rawn hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hêng lal pangate hi a hnêna an rawn hruai chuan Israel mite chu a ko khâwm a, a sipai hruai hotute hnênah chuan, “Lo kal ula, hêng lal pangate hi an nghâwngah rap rawh u,” a ti a. An lo kal a, an nghâwngah an rap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josua chuan, “Hlau mah ta che u, zâm pawh zâm suh u, huai takin ṭang sauh sauh rawh u. Lalpa chuan in do apiang hetiang hian a tihsak dâwn che u asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan lalte chu Josua chuan a that a, thing pangaah a khai a; tlai thlengin an ruang chu a inkhai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni a tlâk dâwnah an ruang chu a lâk thlâktîr a, an bihrûkna pûkah chuan a paihtîr a, pûk kawngka chu lung lian pui puiin an chhîn a, tûn thlengin a la awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Makeda khua chu Josua chuan a bei a, a la a, an lal pawh a man a, khuaa mi zawng zawng chu Jeriko lal a thah ang khân a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Josua chu Makeda aṭang chuan Israel-hote nên Libna-ah an kal a, khua chu an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa chuan chu khua leh an lal chu Israel-te kutah a pe a; khuaa mi zawng zawng chu an sât hlum a, tu mah nungdamin an chhuah lo. An lal pawh Jeriko lal an thah angin an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Libna khua aṭang chuan Josua leh Israel-te chu Lakis khuaah an kal a, an hual a, an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel-te kutah Lakis khua chu Lalpan a pe a, a ni hnih ni-ah an la ta mai a. Libna khua an tih ang bawk khân khuaa mi zawng zawng chu a sât hlum vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gezer khaw lal Horama chu Libna khua pui tûrin a lo chho va, Josua chuan ani chu a sipaite nên a lo hneh a, pakhat mah hmaih lovin a lo that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Josua leh Israel-te chu Libna aṭang chuan Eglon khuaah an kal a, an hual a, an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chumi ni vêk chuan an la a, chumi ni chuan mi awm zawng zawng an sât hlum phiar a, Lakis an sawisak ang bawk khân an sawisa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Josua leh Israel-te chu Eglon aṭang chuan Hebron khuaah an chho va, an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khua chu an la a, chuta awm zawng zawng chu an lal nên lam an sât hlum a, an chhehvêl khuaa awmte pawh an sât hlum a. Eglon khua an tih ang khân Hebron pawh chu an tichhe vek a, tu mah nungdamin an chhuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Josua leh Israel-te chu an kir a, Debir khua an bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khua chu an la a, an lal chu an man a; an chhehvêl khuate pawh an la a. Chûnga awm zawng zawng chu an sât hlum vêk a, Josua chuan Debir khua leh an lal chu Libna khua leh an lal an tih ang khân a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Josua chuan ram chu a la ta vek a. Tlângram te, khawchhak tlâng pang te, khawthlang tlâng bulṭhut phai te, chhim lam ramte nên lam a la a, an lalte chu a hneh vek a, tu mah a zuah lo. Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa thupêk angin thaw thei tawh phawt chu a that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kades-barnea aṭangin Gaza inkâr ram zawng zawng, Gosen ram pawh, Gibeon thlengin Josua chuan a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chûng rama lal zawng zawng leh an ram chu, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chuan a beihpui avângin ṭum khatah Josua chuan a la a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Josua leh Israel-te chu an riahhmun Gilgal-ah chuan an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêng thu hi Hazor lal Jabinan a lo hriat chuan Madon khaw lal Jobaba te, Simron khaw lal te, Aksaf khaw lal te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hmâr lam tlângram lal te, Galili dîl chhim Araba khaw lal te, Mediteranean tuipui kam Dor khaw lal te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />khawchhak lam leh khawthlang lama Kanan lal awm te, Amor-ho lal te, Hit-ho lal te, Periz-ho lal te, tlângrama Jebus-ho lal te, Mizpa ram Hermon tlâng bula Hiv-ho lal te chu a pun khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An sipaite nên an lo thawk a, tuipui kama ṭiau zât hiala tam an ni. Sakawr te, sakawr-tawlailîr te pawh an rawn keng ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hêng lalte hi an ṭangrual a, Israel-te bei tûrin Merom lui kamah ṭanhmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah, “Hêngho hi huphurh suh, naktûk hetih hunah hian tihlum vekin Israel-te hnênah ka hlân ang, an sakawrte chu an tha chhahsak la, an tawlailîrte hâl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josua leh a hruai ṭhin indo mite chu an thawk chhuak a, Merom luiah chuan an va bei thut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te kutah a pe a, an bei a, an thah zawh vek hma chu Misrefotmaim leh Sidon thleng rawkin an ûm a, chhak lamah Mizpa ruam thlengin an ûm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk angin Josua chuan an sakawr tha te chu a chhahsak a, an tawlailîrte chu a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Josua chu a kîr a, Hazor khua a la a, an lal chu a sât hlum a, tûn hma chuan hêng lai khuaah Hazor hi khaw lian ber a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuaa mi zawng zawng chu a sât hlum vek a, thaw thei tawh phawt chu zuah rêng a nei lo. Hazor khua chu a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Josua chuan hêng khua zawng zawng hi a la vek a, an lalte pawh a man a, Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia thu ang khân a tihlum vek zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hazor khua, Josua hâl tih loh chu, Israel-te chuan an khaw tihchhiata in la dingte chu an hâl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng khuaa an râllâk sum leh rante chu Israel-te chuan mahni tân ṭheuh an nei a, mihring erawh chu an sât hlum vek a ni; thaw thei tawh phawt chu hmaih rêng an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh Mosia hnênah Lalpa chuan thu a pe a. Mosia chuan chutiang bawkin Josua chu thu a pe a; chutiang tak chuan Josua chuan a ti a. Mosia hnêna Lalpa sawi, thil bawlhhlawh rêng rêng chu, tihbo loh eng mah a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josuan ram zawng zawng chu a la a, Negeb leh tlângram te, Gosen ram phai te, tlâng bulṭhut phai te, Jordan ruam te, Israel tlângram te, a vêl tlâng bulṭhut phai te chu a la vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ram lâk chuan chhim lamah Halak tlâng, Seir bul aṭangin hmâr lamah Baalgad, Lebanon ruam Hermon tlâng bul a thleng a. An lalte chu a hneh a, a man a, a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Josua leh hêng lal zawng zawng hi rei tak an indo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gibeon khuaa awm Hiv-ho chauh lo chu Israel-te nêna inbe rem khaw pakhat mah an awm lo, a lâkin an la vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te bei tûrin hêngho hi a tiluhlul a ni; Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk angin lainat miah lova tihmang vek an nih phah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Josua chu a kal zêl a, tlângrama Hebron khuaah te, Debir khuaah te, Anab khuaah te, milian Anak an tih la awmte chu a that vek a. Judai leh Israel tlângrama awmte pawh an zavaiin, an khuate nên a tiral vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mite ramah chuan milian rêng an awm tawh lo. Gaza khuaah te, Gath khuaah te, Asdod khuaah te erawh chuan an la awm pheuh pheuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang khân Josua chuan ram a lâka a lâk vek hnuin an ramro atân Israel-te chu a hnam hnamin a sem ta a. Ramah chuan indona a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan chhak lam Arnon lui aṭanga Hermon tlâng thlengin Jordan luiruam ramte chu Israel-te chuan an hneh a, an neihsak tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amor mi, Hesbon lal Sihona leh Basan lal Oga an hneh a. Sihona ram chuan Gilead chanve a huam a ni; Arnon luiruam ko chunga Aroer khua leh Arnon lui kama khua aṭangin Jabok lui a thleng a, chu chu Amon-ho nêna an inrina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ram chuan Jordan kam chhak lam, Galili dîl aṭanga chhim lam lui phai zawng zawng, Beth-jesimot, Tuipui Thi chhak lam Pisga thlengin a huam bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Basan lal Oga chu milian, Refaim an tih la dam awmchhun zînga mi a ni, Astarot leh Edrei khuaah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ram chuan Hermon tlâng te, Seleka te leh Basan ram zawng zawng, Gezer leh Maaka ramri thleng a huam a; Gilead ram zâtve leh Hesbon lal Sihona ramri thlengin a huam bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hêng lal pahnihte hi Mosia hovin Israel-te chuan an hneh a, Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia chuan Reubena thlah leh Gada thlahte leh Manasea thlah zâtve te hnênah an ram chanpual atân a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmâr lama Baal-gad, Lebanon ruama awm leh chhim lam Seir tlâng bula Halak tlâng inkâr ram zawng zawng, Jordan lui khawthlang lama awm leh an lalte chu Josua leh Israel-te chuan an hneh a. Chûng ram chu Josuan Israel hnamte hnênah ram chanpual atân a sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hei hian hêngte hi a huam: tlângram te, khawthlang lam tlâng bulṭhut te, Jordan luiruam te, a dawt tlâng bulṭhut zâwl te, chumi chhak tlâng te leh Negeb thlalêr te hi. Chûng rama lo awmte chu Hit mi te, Amor mi te, Kanan mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te leh Jebus mi te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal an hneh, an thahte chu hêng hi an ni: Bethel khaw bula Ai khaw lal, Gezer lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem lal, Hebron lal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jarmut lal, Lakis lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eglon lal, Gezer lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Debir lal, Geder lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Horma lal, Arad lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Libna lal, Adulam lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Makeda lal, Bethel lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tapua lal, Hefer lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Afek lal, Saron lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Madon lal, Hazor lal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Simron-meron lal, Aksai lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Taanak lal, Megido lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kades lal, Karmel tlânga Jokneam lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mediteranean tuipui kam Dor lal, Gilgal-a Goim lal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tirza lal te hi. An lal thah zawng zawng chu an vaiin sawmthum leh pakhat an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josua chu a lo upa a, a tar ta hle a; Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “I lo upain i tar ta hle a, ram lâk tûr lah chu a la tam mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistia leh Gesur-ho awmna ram te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chhim lam ram Avim-ho awmna te la lâk loh a ni. Aigupta ramri Sihor lui aṭanga hmâr lam Ekron thleng hian Kanan mite rama ngaih a ni. Filistia-ho chu Gaza-ah te, Asdod-ah te, Askelon-ah te, Gath-ah te lalah an ṭhu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kanan-ho ram leh Sidon-ho ram Meara chu Amor ramri Afek thlengin la lâk loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gebal mite ram, Lebanon tlâng chhak lam Hermon tlâng bula Hamath kalkawng thleng lâk loh a la ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Lebanon tlâng leh Misrefot-maim inkâr tlângrama awm zawng zawng Sidon mite chu, keiman Israel mite hmaah ka la ûm chhuak ang; thu ka pêk che angin an ram chanpual atân Israel-te chu pe phawt mai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khai le, ram hi Israel hnam kua leh Manasea thlah zâtve te hnênah, an ram chanpual atân sem rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Manasea thlah zâtve te nên Reubena thlah leh Gada thlahte chuan Jordan chhak lamah ram chanpual tûr Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia pêk kha an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Arnon luiruam ko chunga khua Aroer leh luidung khua aṭangin tlâng zâwl, Medeba leh Dibon inkâr,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amor mi, Hesbon khaw lal Sihona ram zawng zawng Amon-ho ramri thlengin a huam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead ram huamin Gesur-ho leh Maakat-ho awmna nên, Hermon tlâng leh Basan rama Seleka a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Astarot leh Edrei lal Oga ram Basan te a huam a, ani chu Refaim la awmchhunte zînga mi a ni; Mosia khân chûngho chu a hneh a, a ûm chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gesur mite leh Maakat mite chu Israel-te chuan an ûm chhuak lo, tûn thlengin Israel-ho zîngah an la awm ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levia thlahte erawh chu ram chanpual an pe ve lo. Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hnêna an thilhlan hâl bâng chu an chanpual atân pe tûrin Lalpa chuan Mosia chu a hrilh a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosian Reubena thlahte chu a chhûng chhûnga insem tûr ram a pe a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An ram chhim lam ri chu Arnon luiruam ko chung Aroer khua leh lui kama khaw awm kha a ni; Medeba tlâng zâwl te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hesbon khua leh a chhehvêl khua, tlâng zâwla awm te, Dibon te, Mamoth-baal te, Beth-baal-meon te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jahaz leh Kedemot te, Mefaat te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kiriathaim te, Sibma te, Zereth-sahar, ruam zâwla awm te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beth-peor te, Pisga tlâng pang te, Beth-jesimot te a huam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tlâng zâwl khua zawng zawng leh Amor mi Hesbon lal Sihona ram zawng zawng a huam bawk a. Ani chu Mosian a hneh a, Midian hotu Evia te, Rekema te, Zura te, Hura te leh Reba te pawh a huam tel a; hêngho hi Sihona hnuaia rorêltu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel miten Beora fapa Balaama, aienthiam chu an that bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawthlang lama an ramri chu Jordan lui a ni. Reubena thlahte neih atân khîng khawpuite leh an chhehvêl khuate khi an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosia chuan Gada thlahte chu a chhûng chhûnga insem atân an ram chanpual tûr a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An ram chuan Jahaz leh Gilead khawpui zawng zawng a huam a, Amon-ho ram zâtve, Raba chhak lama awm Aroer a huam thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hesbon leh Ramat-mizpa leh Betonim inkâr ram te, Mahanaim aṭanga Lo-debar ri inkâr te a huam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jordan luidungah chuan Beth-haram te, Beth-nimra te, Sukot te, Zafon te leh Hesbon lal Sihona ram ṭhînte a huam tel bawk a. Khawthlang lama an ramri chu Jordan lui, Galili dîl thlengin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gada thlahte neih atân khîng khawpuite leh a chhehvêl khuate khi an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosia chuan Manasea thlah zâtve tân a chhûng chhûnga insem atân ram chanpual an neih tûr a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An ram chuan Mahanaim aṭanga Basan ram, Basan lal Oga ram zawng zawng a huam a, Basan ram Jair bial khaw sawmruk pawh a huam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gilead bial zâtve, Astarot te, Edrei te, Oga ram Basan khawpuite chu a pe tel bawk a. Manasea fa Makira thlahte hnênah khîng ramte khi a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Moab phaia an awm lai khân, Jeriko khaw chhak lam ram chu khitiang khian Mosian a sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mosian Levia thlahte chu ram a ruatsak ve lo. Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hnêna thilhlan chu an chanpual atân a ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan lui thlang lama Kanan ram chu Israel mite hnênah puithiam Eleazara te, Nuna fapa Josua te leh Israel hnam hruaitute chuan hetiang hian an sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk angin hnam kua leh a chanve chan tûrin ṭhum an vâwr a, an sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jordan chhak lama hnam hnih leh a chanve chu Mosian ram chanpual tûr a pe tawh a; an zîngah Levia chite ram a pe ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josefa thlahte kha hnam hnih, Manasea leh Efraim hnamah ṭhen an ni a; mahse, Levia thlahte chu ram chanpual a pe ve lo. Awmna khua erawh chu an bâwngte leh berâm leh kêl tlatna tûr ram nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang chuan Israel-te chuan ram chu an insem ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gilgal-a an awm laiin Juda thlah zînga mi ṭhenkhat Josua hnênah an lo kal a. An zînga pakhat, Keniz mi, Jefunea fapa Kaleba chuan Josua hnênah, “Kades-barnea kan awm laia Pathian mi Mosia hnêna kan pahniha chungchâng Lalpa sawi kha i hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosian he ram hi en thlithlai tûra min tirh khân kum sawmli-a upa ka ni a, thil ka hmuh dân ang chiah ka hrilh a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kalpui, ka unaute khân, mipui an tilunghnûr a, kei erawh chuan ka Pathian, Lalpa thu ka zâwm tlat a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan Pathian, Lalpa thu i zawm tlat avângin i kein a rah ram chu in ram chanpual atân i nei ngei ang,’ tiin Mosian khami ni khân thu a tiam a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khai le, tûnah khatia Mosia hnêna Lalpa thu sawi kha kum sawmli leh panga lai a ni ta a, Israel-te thlalêra an tei an tei lai ata tûn thlengin Lalpa chuan a sawi angin nungdamin min la zuah tâk rêng hi; en teh, kum sawmriat leh panga zu ni ta ia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosian min tirh lai ang mai khân vawiinah pawh ka la chak a ni. Indonaah pawh kala, duh duha chhuakvâk theiin ka la chak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, kan kalpuite nêna thu kan thlen laia Lalpa sawi, he lai tlângram hi, min pe ta mai che, Anak mi, milianho chu kulh lian pui puiah an awm tiin kan hrilh che kha; Lalpa chuan min awmpui ang a, Lalpa thupêk angin ka luhchhuak vek mai thei asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Josua chuan mal a sâwmsak a, Jefunea fapa Kaleba chu ram chanpual atân Hebron chu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa thu chu a awih tak tak avângin tûn thlengin Hebron chu Jefunea fapa, Keniz mi Kaleba ram chanpual a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hebron chu tûn hma chuan Kiriat-arba tih a ni ṭhîn a, chu chu Arba khua tihna a ni. Arba chu Anak-ho zîngah chuan lal ropui ber a ni. Ram chu a râlmuang ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda thlahte, a chhûng chhûnga an insem tûr ram chuan chhim tâwpa Edom ram leh Zin thlalêr a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chhim lam ramri chu Tuipui Thi chhim lam kil tâwpah a inṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhim lam panin Akrabim kalkawng a kal a, Zin thlalêrah a lût a, Kades-barnea chhim lamah Hezron thlengin a kal a, Adar-ah a chho va, Karka lamah a inher a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azmon-ah a kal zêl a, Aigupta ramri luiah a chhuk a, lui chu zuiin Mediteranean tuipui a zu chhun a. Hei hi Judai ram chhim lam ri chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawchhak lam ri chu Tuipui Thi a ni, Jordan lui chhuah thlengin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmâr lam ramri chu Jordan lui chhuahah a inṭan a, Beth-hogla-ah a chho va, Beth-araba hmâr lamah a kal a, Bohana lung a chhun a. Bohana hi Reubena fa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akor ruam aṭangin Debir khuaah a chho va, hmâr lam panin chumi ram chhim tâwpa Adumin kalkawng hawi zâwnga awm Gilgal a thleng a. En-semes tuikhurah a kal zêl a, En-rogel-ah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jebus-ho khua Jerusalem awmna chhim lam ruam Hinom chu a thleng a. Hinom thlang lam tlângah ri chu a kal zêl a, Refaim ruamah a chhuk a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Neftoa tuikhurah a kal a, Efron tlânga khuaahte chuan a kal tlang a; Baala khaw lamah a inher a; chu khua chu Kiriat-jearim an ti bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlang lam hawiin Baala a kal hual a, Seir tlâng a thleng a, Jearim tlâng hmâr lam pangah a kal a, Beth-semes-ah a chhuk a, Timna a kal pêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ekron khaw hmâr lam tlâng a zui a, Sikeron lamah a inher a, Baala tlâng pêlin Jamnia khua a thleng a, chuta ṭangin Mediteranean tuipuiah a tâwp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuipui zau tak chu khawthlang lama a ramri a ni. Chu ramri chhûng chu Juda thlahte awmna tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk angin Josua chuan Jefunea fapa Kaleba chu Juda thlahte ram chan zîngah ram chanpual a pe ve a. Hebron khua, Kiriat-arba an tih, Arba khua chu a nei a, Arba chu Anaka pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaleba chuan Anaka fate pathum Sesaia te, Ahimana te, Talmaia te chu a ûm chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûn hmaa Kiriat-sefer an tih ṭhin Debir khua chu a han bei zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaleba chuan, ‘Kiriat-sefer han beia latu chu ka fanu Aksaii nupuiah ka pe ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kenaz mi, Kaleba nau, Othniela chuan khua chu a la a, Aksaii chu nupuiah a nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A lawi ni chuan a pa hnêna ram dîl tûrin a lo fuih a. A sabengtung ata a chhuk a; Kaleba chuan a hnênah, “Eng nge i duh ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Min khawngaih la, i ram min pêk hi ram ro a ni a, tui awmna min pe tel ta che,” a ti a. Chuanchung leh chuanhnuai tuihna awmna chu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A chhûng chhûnga an insem tûr Juda thlahte chan chu hêng hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chhim berah Edom ramri bâka an neihte chu hêng hi a ni: Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kina, Dimona, Adada,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kedes, Hazor, Itnan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zif, Telem, Bealot;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hazor-hadata, Kiriot-hezron, Hazor an ti bawk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amam, Sema, Molada;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-gada, Hesmon, Beth-pelet;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hazar-sual, Beer-seba, Biziothia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Baala, Iim, Ezem;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eltolad, Kesil, Horma;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziklag, Madmana, Sansana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lebaot, Silhim, Ain, Rimon leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, a vaiin khawpui chu sawmhnih leh pakua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tlâng bulṭhuta awmte chu: Estaol, Zora, Asna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanoa, En-ganim, Tapua, Enam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jarmut, Adulam, Soko, Azeka;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Saaraim, Adithaim, Gedera, Gederothaim leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui chu sâwm leh pali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hêng khuate pawh hi a ni: Zenan, Hadasa, Migdalgad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dilean, Mizpa, Joktheel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lakis, Boskat, Eglon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kabon, Lahmam, Kitlis,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Gederot, Beth-dagon, Naama, Makeda leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui sâwm leh paruk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hêng khuate pawh hi a tel: Libna, Ether, Asan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ifta, Asna, Nezib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keila, Akzib, Maresa leh an chhehvêl khuate nên khawpui pakua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ekron pawh a chhehvêl khuate nên a tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Asdod bula khawpui leh a chhehvêl khuate, Ekron leh Mediteranean tuipui inkâra khuate pawh a tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Asdod leh Gaza, an chhehvêl khuate nên, Aigupta ramri lui nêna an inkâr Mediteranean tuipui kama khaw awmte a tel bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tlângramah hêng khuate hi a tel bawk: Samir, Jatir, Soko,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Danna, Kiriat-sana, Debir tih a ni bawk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Anab, Estemo, Anim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gosen, Holon, Gilo leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui sâwm leh pakhat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hêng khuate pawh hi a tel: Arab, Duma, Esan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Janim, Beth-tapua, Afeka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Humta, Hebron, Zior leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui pakua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hêng khuate pawh hi a tel: Maon, Karmel, Zip, Juta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kain, Gibea, Timna leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui sâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hêng khuate pawh hi a tel: Halhul, Beth-zur, Gedor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Maarat, Beth-anot, Eltekon leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui paruk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Hêng khuate pawh hi a tel: Kiriat-baal, Kiriat-jearim an ti bawk, Raba leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui pahnih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Thlalêrah hêng khuate hi a awm: Beth-araba, Midin, Sekaka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Nibsan, chi khawpui (Ir-hmalak), Engedi leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui paruk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Juda thlahte chuan Jebus-ho, Jerusalema awmte chu an hnawt chhuak zo lo. Juda thlahte nên, Jebus-ho chu tûn thlengin an la awm ho ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josefa thlahte ram chan chhim lam ri chu Jordan luia Jeriko lui chhuah bulah a inṭan a, Jeriko kal tlangin thlang lam tlâng lamah a chho va, thlalêr kal tlangin Bethel a chhun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Luz khaw thlengin Ark-ho awmna Atarot-ah a kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thlang lam hawiin Jaflet-ho awmna ram a kal tlang a, Beth-horon chuanhnuai a chhun a. Gezer kal tlangin Mediteranean tuipui a chhun a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josefa thlahho, Efraim leh Manasea thlahte chuan hei hi ram chanpual atân an chang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Efraim thlahte, a chhûng chhûnga an insem tûra an chan hmâr lam ramri chu hetiang hi a ni: Chhak lama awm Atarot-adar leh Beth-horon inkâr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmâr tâwp khua Mikmethat aṭangin khawchhak lam panin ri chu Tanat-silo-ah a kal a, Janoa khuaah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Atarot khuaah te, Naara khuaah te a kal a, Jeriko a chhun a, Jordan lui a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawthlang lamah Mikmethat khua aṭangin Tapua khuaah, Kana luia chhuakin luidung chu a zui a, Mediteranean a zu thleng a. Chumi chhûng ram chu Efraima thlahten a chhûng chhûnga an insem tûra an chan ram chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasea thlahte chan aṭangin Efraim-ho chu khawpui ṭhenkhat, an chhehvêl khuate nên an pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gezer khuaa lo awm Kanan mite chu an ûm chhuak lo, tûn thlengin chûng Kanan mite chu Efraim-ho zîngah an la awm, chhiahhlawhah an chhawr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josefa fa tîr, Manasea thlahte ram chan chu hei hi a ni: Josefa fapa upa zâwk Manasea fapa Makira, Gileada pa chu, mi huaisen a ni a. Jordan chhak lama Gilead leh Basan ram chu a chanpualah an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jordan thlang lamah Manasea fa dangte tân ram an pe bawk a, chûng mite chu: Abiazera, Heleka, Asriela, Sekema, Hefera leh Semida te an ni. Hêngho hi Josefa fapa Manasea fa, mipaho chhûngkaw lute chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hefera fapa Zelofehada chuan fapa nei lovin fanu chauh a nei a. A pu chu Makira, Manasea fa a ni. Zelofehada fanute chu, Mahlaii te, Novaii te, Hoglaii te, Milkaii te, Tirzaii te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Puithiam Eleazara te, Nuna fapa Josua te leh Israel hnam hotu te hnênah an lo kal a, “ Lalpa chuan kan unau mipate ang bawkin ram min pe ve tûrin Mosia a hrilh kha,” an rawn ti a. Lalpa thupêk ang chuan an unau mipate ang bawkin ram chu an chang ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan chhak lama Gilead leh Basan ram telin Manasea thlahte chan sâwm an nei bîk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipa ang bawka an fa hmeichhiaten ram an chan ve tâk avângin Gilead ram chu Manasea thlah dangten an chang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manasea thlahte ram chan chu Aser-ho ram chan aṭangin Sekem khaw chhak lam Mikmethat khaw inkâr chu a ni. Chhim zâwngin ramri chu a kal a, Entapua-a awmte chu a huam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tapua ram hi Manase-ho chan a ni, a khawpui Tapua erawh hi chu Efraim-ho ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ramri chu Kana luitêah a chhuk a. Luite kam chhim lama khuate chu Efraim-ho ta a ni, Manase-ho ram chhûnga awm ni mah se; ramri chu luite hmâr lam kamah a kal zêl a, Mediteranean tuipuiah a chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhim lamah Efraim-ho an awm a, hmâr lamah Manase-ho an awm a nih chu; Aser-ho chu hmârthlang lamah an awm a, an ram hmârchhak lamah Isakar-ho an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aser-ho leh Isakar-ho chan chhûngah Manase khua Beth-sean leh Ibleam khawpui, an chhehvêl khuate nên a awm. Tuipui kama Dor khua te, Endor te, Taanak te, Megido te leh an chhehvêl khuate pawh a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêng khuaa awmte hi Manasea thlahte chuan an ûm chhuak thei lo; chuvângin, Kanan-ho chu an la awm ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel-ho an lo chak hle hnu pawh khân an hnawt chhuak chuang lo, hna thawk tûr erawh chuan an phût lui ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Josefa thlahte chuan, “ Lalpa chuan mal min sâwm a, kan rual ta hle si a, hmun khat chauh engati nge min pêk le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josua chuan, “In rual viau a, Efraim tlângram hi a zîm deuh a nih chuan Periz leh Refaim-ho awmna ram ngâwte han tu-dar mai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anni chuan, “A tlângram ngawt chu a zîm deuh vang; phaia Kanan-ho lahin thîr-tawlailîr an nei a; Jezreel phaia awmte leh Beth-sean khawpui leh a chhehvêl khuate chuan indo thîr-tawlailîr an nei vek a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Josua chuan Efraim leh Manasea thlahte chu a chhâng a, “In parual hle a, in chak hle bawk alâwm. Chan khat mai ni lo in nei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlângram khi in chan tûr a ni ang. Ngaw hlîr ni mah se, tu-dar ula, a pumin hneh ang che u, Kanan-ho chu an thîr-tawlailîrte nên chak hle mah se, in ûm chhuak mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite chu Silo-ah an lo pung khâwm a, Inbiakna bûk kha an zâr a, ram chu an la tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel zîngah hnam sarih an chan tûr sem ve loh an la awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josua chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa , in pate Pathianin ram a pêk che u hi in va luah har ve?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnam tinin mi pathum thlang chhuak ula, anni chu ram fang chhuak tûrin ka lo tîr ang e; hnam tin chanpual tûr ruat sela, ka hnênah rawn thlen rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram chu hmun sarihah ṭhen sela, Juda leh Josefa thlahte chu an chan ram chhûngah an awm mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram hmun sariha ṭhen dân tûr chu an ziak chhuak ang a, an rawn keng ang a, keiin Lalpa , kan Pathian hmaah ṭhum ka lo vâwrsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levia chite chu sem ve suh u, Lalpa puithiam hna hi an chanvo ve tûr chu a ni si a. Reubena te, Gada te leh Manasea thlah zâtve te lahin Jordan chhak lamah, Pathian chhiahhlawh Mosia khân an chan tûr chu a pêk tawh kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josua sawi anga ti tûr chuan mite chu an thawk chhuak a, an hnênah, “Ram pum fang chhuak ula, chhinchhiah vek ang che u; chutah in lo haw leh dâwn nia. Keiin Lalpa hmaah ṭhum ka lo vâwrsak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng mite chu an chhuak a, ram chu an fang vek a, khawpui awmte chhinchhiah vekin hmun sarihah an sem a, an ziak chhuak a. Silo khuaa riahhmunah Josua hnênah an ziakna bu chu an rawn hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Silo khuaah chuan Josuan Lalpa hmaah ṭhum a vâwr a, Israel mite chu a hnam hnamin ram chu a sem ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benjamin thlahte chan tûr, a chhûng chhûnga insem tûr chu ruat hmasak ber a ni a, Juda leh Josefa thlahte inkârah an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An hmâr lam ramri chu Jordan lui aṭangin Jeriko ep tlâng pangah a chho va; khawthlang zâwngin Beth-aven thlalêr a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Luz khuaah (Bethel an ti bawk) a kal zêl a, chhim lam zâwngin a kal a, Atarot-adar, Beth-horon tlâng chuanhnuaia khua chu a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />He tlâng thlang lamah, chhim zâwngin ramri chu a inher a, Kiriat-baal khua, Kiriat-jearim an tih bawk chu a thleng a; he khua hi Juda thlahte chan khawpui a ni. Hei hi khawthlang lama a ramri chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chhim lam ramri chu Kiriat-jearim aṭangin a inṭan a, chhak lam panin Nefto tuikhurah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinom chhuntu tlângdunga kalin Refaim phai luhnaah a chhuk a, Hinom ruam a pan a, Jebus-ho khaw chhim lamah a kal a, En-rogel a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmâr lamah a inher a, En-semes a thleng a; Adumin kalkawng epa Gelilot khuaah a kal a, Bohana lungah (Bohana chu Reubena fapa a ni) a kal zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jordan dep tlâng hmâr lama kalin ruamah a chhuk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Beth-hogla tlângdung hmâr lamah a kal zêl a, Jordan lui chhuah Tuipui Thiah a chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hei hi Benjamina thlah chhûng tin ram chan tûr ramri chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamina thlah, a chhûng chhûnga an insem tûr khuate chu hêng hi a ni: Jeriko, Beth-hogla, Emek-kezia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beth-araba, Zemaraim, Bethel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Avim, Para, Ofra;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kefaramoni, Ofni, Geba leh an chhehvêl khuate nên khawpui sâwm leh pahnih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon te, Rama te, Beerot te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizpa te, Kafira te, Moza te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Rekem te, Irpeel te, Tarala te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zela te, Haelef te, Jebus te (Jerusalem an ti bawk), Gibea te, Kiriat-jearim te leh an chhehvêl khua te nên, khawpui sâwm leh pali a ni. Hêng hi Benjamin thlah chhûng tin chan tûr khua chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chan hnihna chu Simeona thlahten a chhûng chhûnga an insem tûrin an chang a. An ram chan chu Juda thlahte ram chan chhûnga mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hêng hi a huam: Beer-seba, Seba, Molada;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hazar-sual, Bala, Ezem;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eltolad, Bethul, Horma;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziklag, Beth-markabot, Hazar-susa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth-lebaot, Saruhen leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui chu sâwm leh pathum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng pawh hi a tel: Ain, Rimon, Ether, Asan leh an chhehvêl khuate, khawpui pali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hei hian an chhehvêl khua Balat-beer (Rama an tih bawk) chhim lam thlengin a huam a ni. Simeona thlahte chuan he lai ram hi an chanpual atâna an dawn chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda thlahte hian an mamawh aia zau ram an neih avângin an ram ṭhenkhat chu Simeona thlahte hnêna pêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zebuluna thlahten a chhûng chhûnga insem tûr ram chan thumna chu an chang a, a chhim tâwpah Sarid khua a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuta ṭangin thlang lamah Marala a pan a, Dabeset pal tlangin Jokneam chhak lama luiah a chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sarid chhak lamah Kislot-tabor ramri a han chhun a, Daberat pal tlangin ramri chu Jafia-ah a chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhuk zâwngin Gath-hefer-ah a kal zêl a, Eth-kazin thlengin Rimon kawnga Nea panin a kual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmâr lam panin ramri chu Hanathon-ah a kal a, Iftahel ruamah a tâwp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kata te, Nahalal te, Simron te, Idala te, Bethlehem te leh an chhehvêl khuate nên khawpui sâwm leh pahnih a huam tel a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zebulun-ho chan ramah chuan hêng khawpui leh an chhehvêl khuate hi a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chan lina chu Isakara thlahte chuan a chhûng chhûnga insem tûrin an chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hêng hi a huam: Jezreel, Kesulot, Sunem;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Haferaim, Sion, Anaharat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rabit, Kision, Ebez;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Remet, En-ganim, En-hada, Beth-pazez.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An ramri chuan Tabor tlâng a kal tlang a, Sahazumai leh Beth-semes kal tlangin Jordan a thleng a, khawpui sâwm leh paruk leh an chhehvêl khuate nên a huam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isakara thlahte chuan chhûng tin insem tûrin hêng khawpuite hi, an chhehvêl khuate nên an chang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chan ngana chu Asera thlahte chuan a chhûng chhûnga insem tûrin an chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hêng hi a huam tel: Helkat, Hali, Beten, Aksaf;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Alam Melek, Amad, Misal. Khawthlang lama a ramri chuan Karmel leh Sihor-libnat a pal tlang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />khawchhak zâwngin a inher a, Beth-dagon pal tlangin Zebulun ram a chhun a, Iftahel ruamah a lût a, hmâr lam panin Beth-emek leh Neiel a pan a, Kabul a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ebron-ah te, Rehob-ah te, Hamon-ahte, Kana-ah te a kal a, Sidon khawpui a chhun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ramri chu a inher a, Rama leh Tura khawpui kulh a chhun a, Hosa-ah a inher a, Mediteranean tuipuiah a tâwp a. Mahalab te, Akzib te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Uma te, Afek te, Rehob te leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui sawmhnih leh pahnih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hêng khawpui leh an chhehvêl khuate hi Asera thlahte chuan chhûng tin insem atân an ram chan chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chan rukna chu Naftalia thlahte chuan a chhûng chhûnga an insem tûrin an chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hmâr lam ramri chu Helef-ah a inṭan a, chhak lamah Elon-Bazananim kal tlangin Adami-nekeb-ah a kal a, Jabneel tlawhin Lakum a thleng a, Jordan-ah a tâwp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khawthlang lam panin Aznot-tabor-ah a kal a, Hukok a thleng a, chhim lamah Zebulun hrûlah a kal a, Aser-ho ram a va chhun a. Chhak lamah Jordan, thlang lamah Aser-ho ram a ri a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kulh nei khua te: Zidim, Zer, Hamath, Rakat, Kineret;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Adama, Rama, Hazor;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedes, Edrei, En-hazor;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Iron, Migdalel, Horem, Bethanat, Beth-semes leh an chhehvêl khuate nên, khawpui sâwm leh pakua a huam tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hêng khawpuite leh an chhehvêl khuate hi Naftali thlahte chuan chhûng tin insem atân an chang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chan sarihna chu Dana thlahten a chhûng chhûnga insem atân an chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hêng hi a huam: Zora, Estaol, Ir-semes;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Saalabin, Aijalon, Ithla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Elon, Timna, Ekron;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Elteke, Gibethon, Baalat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehud, Bene-berak, Gath-rimon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mejarkon, Rakon leh Jopa khaw vêl ramte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Dana thlahte hi hmêlmaten an ram an lâksak a, Lais khuaah an kal a; an bei a, an la a, mite chu an that a; anmahni tân an nei ta a. A khaw hming hi an thlahtu hming chawiin Dan an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hêng khawpuite leh an chhehvêl khuate hi Dana thlahte chuan chhûng tin insem tûrin an chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ram an insem zawh chuan, Israel mite chuan Nuna fapa Josua chu a hranpain ram an pe ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk angin a duhthlan Timnat-sera khua an pe a, Efraim tlângrama awm a ni; khua chu a din ṭha a, a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Puithiam Eleazara te, Nuna fapa Josua te leh Israel hnam hruaitu te chuan hêng ram hrang hrang hi ṭhumvâwrin Silo khuaah chuan Inbiakna bûk kawngkaah an sem fel ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Josua hnênah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mite hrilh rawh, Mosia ka hrilh ang khân inhumhimna tûr khua ruat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tihpalh emaw, hmuh loh avâng emawa mihring tihlum palhte thisen phuba latu laka an tlân a, an him theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng khuaah chuan an tlân ang a, khawpui luhnaah an ding ang a, chu khaw upate hnênah chuan an lo tlân chhan an hrilh tûr a ni; anni chuan hmun an lo ngaihtuahsak ang a, an zîngah an awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thisen phuba latuin an rawn ûm pawhin an lo hum tûr a ni; an tihpalh a ni a, huat vânga tihlum an ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu khuaah chuan Israel pungkhâwmin a chungthu an rêl fel hma emaw, puithiam lalber ṭang lai a thih hma emaw a awm tûr a ni; chumi zawhah chuan mi that palhtu chu a lo kalna, an khuaah, ama inah ngei a haw leh thei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng khuate hi Israel mite tân leh an zînga awm hnam dangte tân inhumhimna tûra an ruatte chu a ni; Kades khua, Naftali ram tlângram Galili bialah; Sekem khua, Efraim-ho ram tlângramah; Kiriat-arba khua (Hebron an ti bawk), Juda thlahte ram chhûng tlângramah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jordan chhak lamah: Bezer khua, Reuben-ho ram tlâng zâwl thlalêr khuaah; Ramot khua, Gad-ho bialah; Golan khua, Manasea-ho ram Basan bialah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khîng khi a ni Israel mite leh an zînga hnam dang awmte tâna inhumhimna tûr khua an ruatte chu. Tu pawhin mi tihlum palh sela, hêng khuaah hian an tlân thei ang; an chungthu Israel pung khâwmin an rel fel hma chu thisen phuba latu kutah an thi mai dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levia chi hruaitute chu, puithiam Eleazara te, Nuna fapa Josua te leh Israel hnam hruaitute hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kanan ram Silo khuaah chuan an lo kal a, “ Lalpa chuan kan awmna tûr, khawpuite leh a chhehvêl ran tlatna tûr ram âwl pe tûrin Mosia chu a hrilh kha,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite chuan, an ram chan chhûngah hêng khawpuite hi, a chhehvêl ram âwl, ran tlatna tûr nên, Lalpa thu angin Levia chite chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levia thlah zîngah Kohata thlahte chu khawpui an sem hmasa ber a. Arona thlah puithiamho chu Juda thlah te, Simeona thlahte leh Benjamina thlahte ram chan aṭangin khawpui sâwm leh pathum an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kohata thlahte chu Efraim te, Dan te leh khawthlang lama Manase thlah zâtve ram aṭangin khawpui sâwm an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gersona thlahte chu Isakar te, Naftali te, khawthlang lama Manase te chan aṭangin khawpui sâwm leh pathum an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meraria thlahte chu Reuben te, Gad te leh Zebulun ram aṭang tein khawpui sâwm leh pahnih an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosia hnênah Lalpa thupêk angin Israel mite chuan ṭhumvâwrin hêng khuate hi a chhehvêl ram âwl, ran tlatna tûr nên Levia chite chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda leh Manasea thlahte ram aṭangin hêng khawpuite hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Levia thlah Kohata fa Arona thlahte hnêna an pêk chu a ni a; anni hi khua an sem dawng hmasa ber an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda tlângram khawpui Anaka pa, Arba khua, Hebron an tih bawk chu, a chhehvêla ram âwlte nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khawpui chhehvêla ram leh khuate chu Jefunea fapa Kaleba hnêna pêk a nih tawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Inhumhimna tûr khuaa ruat Hebron khaw bâkah hêng khawpuite hi puithiam Arona thlahte tân an ruat: Libna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jatir, Estemoa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Holon, Debir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ain, Juta, Beth-semes, an chhehvêl ram âwlte nên Juda leh Simeona thlahte ram chan aṭangin khawpui pakua an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin ram aṭangin hêng khawpui pali hi an pe bawk: Gibeon, Geba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anathot, Almon leh an chhehvêl ram âwlte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A vaiin khaw sâwm leh pathum, an chhehvêl ram âwl, ran tlatna tûr nên puithiam Arona thlahte chu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levia fa Kohata thlah dangte hnênah Efraim-ho ram aṭangin khaw ṭhenkhat an pe bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khawpui pali an pe; inhumhimna tûra ruat Efraim tlângrama khawpui Sekem te, Gezer te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kibzaim te, Beth-horon te leh an chhehvêl ram âwlte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan ram aṭangin khaw pali an pe bawk: Elteke te, Gibethon te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aijalon te, Gath-rimon te leh an chhehvêl ram âwlte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thlang lama awm Manasea thlahte ram aṭangin khawpui pahnih an pe: Taanak leh Gath-rimon leh an chhehvêl ram âwlte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kohata thlah dangte hnênah chuan hêng khaw sâwm leh an chhehvêl ram âwl; ran tlatna tûr te nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Levia chi, pâwl khat, Gersona thlahte chu chhak lam Manasea thlahte rama mi khawpui pahnih an pe a; inhumhimna tûra ruat Basan biala Golan leh Beestera te leh an chhehvêl ram âwl, ran tlatna tûr nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isakara thlahte ram aṭangin khawpui pali - Kision te, Daberat te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jarmut te, En-ganim te, an chhehvêl ram âwl, ran tlatna tûr nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aser-ho ram aṭangin khawpui pali - Misal te, Abdon te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Helkat te, Rehob te leh an chhehvêl ram awl, ran tlatna tûr nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Naftali-ho ram aṭangin khawpui pathum - inhumhimna tûra ruat Galili rama Kedes te, Hamot-dor te, Kartan te leh an chhehvêl ram âwl ran tlatna tûr nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gersona thlah chhûngkaw hrang hrang chuan khawpui sâwm leh pathum leh a vêl ram âwl ran tlatna tûr nên an chang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Levia chi mi dang, Meraria thlahte chu Zebulun-ho ram aṭangin khawpui pali - Jokneam te, Karta te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dimna te, Nahalal te leh an chhehvêl ram âwl, ran tlatna tûrte nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Reuben-ho ram aṭangin khawpui pali - Bezer te, Jahaz te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedemot te, Mefaat te leh an chhehvêl ram âwl; ran tlatna tûr nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gad-ho ram aṭangin khawpui pali - inhumhimna tûra ruat Gilead biala Ramot te, Mahanaim te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hesbon te, Jazer te, an chhehvêl ram âwl; ran tlatna tûr te nên an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Meraria thlahte chu a vaiin khawpui sâwm leh pahnih an pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel mite ram chhûnga Levia chite khawpui atâna ruat chu khaw sawmli leh pariat a ni, an chhehvêl ram âwl, ran tlatna tûr nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lalpa chuan an thlahtute hnêna ram pêk a tiam tlat ram zawng zawng chu Israel mite hnênah chuan a pe ta a. An lâk hnu chuan an luah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />An thlahtute hnêna pêk a lo tiam tawh ram chu Lalpa chuan Israel-te chu a pe a, an lâk hnu chuan awmhmun an khuar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a tiam angin ram pum chu a tirâlmuang a; an hmêlmate a hnehtîr zêl ṭhin avângin tu mahin an lo dang zo lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Israel-te hnêna thu a tiam tawh phawt chu Lalpa chuan a hlen zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josua chuan Reubena thlah te, Gada thlahte leh Manasea thlah zâtve te chu a ko va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an hnênah, “ Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia thu in awih a, ka hrilh apiang che u in zâwm zêl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />in unaute chu hun rei tak chhûng hâwnsan mai lovin in Pathian, Lalpa thupêk in zâwm thlap zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tûnah zawng, Lalpa , in Pathianin a tiam angin in unau Israel-te chu râlmuang takin a awmtîr tâk hi. Chuvângin, Lalpa , in Pathian chhiahhlawh Mosian Jordan râla ram a pêk che u-ah haw tawh rawh u le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosian dân a pêk che u kha zâwm ngei ula, in Pathian, Lalpa chu hmangaihin a thupêkte chu awih ula, a duhzâwng ti ṭhîn ula, amah chu vuan tlatin, tihtak zet leh ṭhahnemngai takin a rawng bâwl ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Josuan mal a sâwm a, a hawtîr a; in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosia khân Manasea thlah zâtve chu Jordan chhak lamah Basan ram a pe a, a zâtve dang hnênah Josuan Jordan thlang lamah ram a pe bawk a. Josuan a hâwntîr khân mal a sâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Berâm leh kêl te, tangka leh rangkachak te, dâr leh thîr te leh thawmhnaw tam tak nên, hausa hnawkin in haw dâwn a, in hmêlmate thil in lâksakte chu in unau dangte sem ve ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Reubena thlah te, Gada thlah te leh Manasea thlah zâtve te chu Silo khua aṭang chuan an haw ta a. Israel dangte chu Kanan rama Silo khuaah chuan an kalsan a. Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk angin an ram chan Gilead ram chu an pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Reubena thlah te, Gada thlahte leh Manasea thlah zâtve te chuan Jordan thlang lama awm, Kanan rama Galilot chu an thleng a, lui kamah chuan hmuhnawm tham taka ropuiin maichâm an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mi dangte chu, “Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te leh Manase-ho te chuan Kanan ram Jordan lui kamah, Israel mite ram lamah chuan maichâm an siam luah mai,” tiin an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel pungkhâwmhovin an lo hriatin beih an tum a, Silo-ah an lo kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te, Manase-ho zâtve te chu Gilead-a an awm laiin Israel mite chuan puithiam Eleazara fapa Finehasa chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel hnam sâwm hruaitute, khawthlang lam hnam sâwm hruaitu ber pakhat zêl nên an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gilead an lo thleng a, Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te leh Manase-ho zâtve te hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Pungkhâwmho, Lalpa mite chuan, he thil sual tak hi Israel-te Pathian chungah engtiziaa ti nge in nih? He maichâm in siam hi Lalpa chungah in hel ta tihna a ni, a thu in awih ta lo a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peor hmuna thil sual kan tih kha in la hre reng lâwm ni? Lalpa chuan ama mite ngei pawh hri a veitîr a, a hrem a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chu engtizia nge in zui duh loh? Vawiina Lalpa chunga in hel avângin naktûkah chuan Israel pungkhâwmho chungah a thinur dâwn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In ram hi amah biakna tlâk loh khawpa bawlhhlawh a nih chuan Lalpa bûk, Inbiakna bûk awmna lamah lo kal ula, kan zîngah ram in nei ve mai tûr alâwm; Lalpa lakah leh kan laka helin kan Pathian maichâm lo chu maichâm dang siam teh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zera fapa Akana khân thil serh a bawhchhia a, Israel pungkhâwmho chungah thinurna a thleng a, amah mai ni lovin mi dang pawh an thih kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te, Manase-ho zâtvete chuan Israel hotute chu an chhâng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“ Lalpa chu pathiante Pathian a ni. Pathiante Pathian, Lalpa chuan kan tih chhan a hria alâwm; nangni pawhin hre ve ula kan duh asin. Lalpa laka hel kan niha, a laka rinawm lo kan nih chuan, min zuah lo mai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa thu awih lovin hâlral thilhlan te, buhbâl thilhlan te, remna thilhlante kan hlanna tûr keimahni maichâm kan siam a nih hrim chuan Lalpa ngei chuan min hrem rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutiang a ni lo; nakinah in thlahten kan thlahte hnênah hetiang hian an la ti ang tih kan hlau a ni zâwk:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu be ve tûr em in nih? Jordan lui chu Reuben leh Gad-ho nêna kan inri atân a siam a, Lalpa hi be ve tûr in ni lo’ tiin in thlahte chuan kan thlahte an la khap mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, hâlral thilhlan leh inthawina chi dang hlan nân maichâm hi siam kan ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />In mite leh kan mite, ṭhangthar zêlten, Lalpa hnênah ngei kan hâlral thilhlan te, remna thilhlante leh inthawinate kan hlân ṭhîn tih an hriat theih nân leh in thlahten kan thlahte hnênah, ‘ Lalpa rawn be tûr in ni lo,’ an tih loh nâna siam kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, chutianga kan thlahte hnêna an tih tâkin ‘Min thlahtute hian Lalpa maichâm ang chiahin he maichâm hi an lo siam a ni, hâlral thilhlan emaw, inthawina emaw kan hlanna tûr a ni lo,’ tia an chhân theih nân siam kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa lakah hel kan tum awzâwng lo, amah hawisanin kan thilhlan hâlna, kan buhbâl thilhlan leh inthawinate hlanna tûr maichâm hrang siam kan tum a ni hek lo, kan Pathian maichâm, a Bâwkte kawta mi lo kha chu maichâm hrang kan din dâwn hauh lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Puithiam Finehasa leh pungkhâwmho hruaitu, khawthlang lama awm hnam hruaitu sâwmte chuan Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te, Jordan chhak lam Manase-ho zâtve te thu chu an hriatin an lungawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Finehasa, Puithiam Eleazara fapa chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa zawngin min lo awmpui ngei zawng a lo ni tih kan hre ta e; Lalpa lakah in lo hel loh hi; Lalpa pawhin Israel-te a hrem dâwn lo a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Reubena leh Gada thlahte awmna Gilead aṭang chuan puithiam Eliazara fapa Finehasa leh Israel hotute chu Israel mite awmna Kanan ramah chuan an kîr a, an thu chu an thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel mite chu an lung a awi ta a, Pathian an fak a; Reubena leh Gada thlahte chu an awmna ram aṭanga nuai bo tûra thawh chhuah thu an sawi ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Reubena thlah leh Gada thlahte chuan chu maichâm chu “Kan inkârah Lalpa hi Pathian chu a ni tih hretu a ni,” an ti a, Thuhretu an vuah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te chu an hmêlmate laka rei fe râlmuang taka a awmtîr hnu chuan Josua chu a kum a tamin a lo upa ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng - upa te, hruaitu te, rorêltu te leh hotu te chu a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “Ka lo upain ka lo tar ta hle mai a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmahni avângin hêng lai hnamte chunga in Pathian, Lalpa thiltihte in hmu a; Lalpa , in Pathian chu in hmêlmate dosaktu che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan hneh tawhho hnam awmna ram leh kan la hneh lohte awmna ram chu in ram chanpual atân ka sem fel vek tawh che u a ni; khawchhak lamah Jordan lui aṭanga khawthlang lama Mediteranean tuipui thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa in Pathianin in hmaah a tlânchhiattîr zêl ang a, a ûm bo vek ang; Lalpa , in Pathianin a tiam tawh angin an ram chu in neihsak ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, Mosia dân lehkhabua ziak apiang awih tum tlat ula, ti ngei ang che u, pakhat mah hmaih suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In zînga hnam dang la awmte nên hian inchiahpiah suh u; an pathian lam suh ula, an hming chhâlin chhia chham hek suh u: chibai bûkin an hmaah kûn tawp suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu vuan tlat zâwk ang che u, tûn thleng pawha in la vuan ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnam tam tak leh chak pui pui in hmaah Lalpa chuan a hnawt chhuak zêl a, tu mah lo dang thei che u an awm lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A tiam angin Lalpa in Pathian chuan in hmêlmate a dosak che u avângin mi pakhat pawhin sâng têl in ûm a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chu hmangaih ngei ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In hawisana, in zînga hnam dang lo awmte nên in inchiahpiaha, in inneih pawlh vaih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chuan hêng hnamte hi in hmaah a hnawh chhuahsak tawh hauh lo vang che u. Lalpa , in Pathianin he ram ṭha tak a pêk che u aṭanga in boral vek hma chu in tân thang leh tlâkna khur hlauhawm an ni ang a, vuakna hruihrual leh mita chhuntu hlîng an ni ang tih hre chiang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, tûnah zawng, leilung dân angin ka kal a hun ta. Tu pawhin ngun taka in chhût chuan Lalpa , in Pathian chuan thil ṭha a tiam zawng zawng che u chu a pe zêl che u tih in hria ang. A tiam ang chuan a ti zêl a, pakhat mah tih loh a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chuan thil ṭha a tiam chu a hlen zêl ang ngeiin a pêk che u ram aṭanga in boral vek hma chu thil ṭha lo tih a tiam pawh chu a ti ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathianin zâwm tûra a tih che u, a thuthlung chu in bawhchhiata, pathian dangte in pana, an rawng in bâwl chuan, Lalpa thinur chu a alh ang a, ram ṭha tak a pêk che u aṭang hian in boral mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josua chuan Israel hnamte chu Sekem khuaah a ko khâwm a. Israel upa te, an hnam hruaitu te, rorêltu te leh hotu te chu Pathian hmaah an rawn inlan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Josua chuan mi zawng zawng hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Hmânlaiin in thlahtute chu Eufretis lui piahah an awm ṭhîn a, pathian dangte an be ṭhîn. Chûng zînga pakhat chu Abrahama leh Nahora pa Tera a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In pu Abrahama chu Eufretis lui piah aṭang chuan Kanan ram pumah ka hruai kual a, fapa Isaka ka pe a, a thlahte ka tipung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaka chu fapa Jakoba leh Esauva ka pe a, Seir tlângte chu Esauva hnênah a chênna atân ka pe a. Jakoba leh a fate erawh chu Aigupta ramah an chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nakinah chuan Mosia leh Arona chu ka tîr a, Aigupta mite chu ka timangang nasa hle a; nangni erawh chu ka hruai chhuak ta che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In pute chu Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak a, Aigupta mite chuan sakawrtawlailîr nên, sakawr chungchuang mite nên an rawn ûm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mahse, Tuipui Sen an lo thlen khân mangangin Lalpa an au va, Aigupta mite nêna an inkârah thim a awmtîr a, tuipui chuan Aigupta mite chu a chîm a, an pil ta a. Aigupta rama ka thiltihte chu in hria a, thlalêrah rei fe in awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jordan chhak lama awm Amor mite awmna chu ka hruai thleng che u a, in indo va, ka hnehtîr che u a; an ram chu in nei ta a. In hmaah anni chu ka tiboral a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Zipora fapa Balaka, Moab lal chuan Israel-te chu a lo bei a; Beora fapa Balaama chu ânchhia lawh tûr che uin a pun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Balaama thiltum chu ka remti lo va, mal a sâwmsak ta hlauh zâwk che u a; chutiang chuan Balaka kut ata ka chhan che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jordan lui in kai a, Jeriko khuaa mite chuan an lo bei che u a; Amor mi te, Periz mi te, Kanan mi te, Hit mi te, Girgas mi te, Hiv mi te leh Jebus mi te pawhin an lo bei che u a; mahse, ka hnehtîr vek che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amor lal pahnih phei chu khandaih emaw, thal emaw hman ngai lovin in hmaah khawinghal ka ûm chhuahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In chei hah ni hauh lo ram ka pe che u a, in sak hah loh khawpuiah ka awmtîr che u a. Tûnah zawng in phun loh grep rah in tlân a, in phun loh oliv rah in ei hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Lalpa chu zah ula, tihtak zetin a rawng bâwl tlat rawh u. Mesopotamia ram leh Aigupta rama in pute biak ṭhin pathian lemte kha paih vek rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa rawngbâwl hi ṭha in tih loh chuan in thlahtute biak, Mesopotamia rama pathiante rawng kha nge in bâwl duh, tûna in awmna rama Amor-ho pathiante hi, vawiin hian in duh zâwk chu thlang rawh u. Kei leh ka chhûngte erawh hi zawngin Lalpa rawng a ni kan bâwl dâwn ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipui chuan, “ Lalpa rawngbâwl hi ṭha lo kan ti awzâwng hlei nêm: pathian dangte rawng chu kan bâwl hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta rama bawiha kan awm min hruaichhuaktu chu Lalpa , kan Pathian hi a ni alâwm; kan hmuhah thil ropui tak tak te a ti a, hnam tin chi tin zînga kan kalna apiangah min hum zêl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He ram kan lo thlen pawh khân Lalpa chuan kan hmaah hênga awm Amor-hote a hnawt chhuak vek a nih kha. Chuvângin, Lalpa rawng a ni kan bâwl dâwn ni, amah chauh hi kan Pathian chu a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josua chuan mipui hnênah, “ Lalpa rawng hi in bâwl thei ngût ang emaw chu: Mi thianghlim a ni a, pathian dang rêng a ngaithei lo va, in bawlhhlawhnate, in sualte a ngaidam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chu hawisanin pathian dang rawng in bâwl vaih chuan a hawisan ang che u a, a hrem ang che u; in chungah ṭha hle ṭhîn mah se, a tiboral mai ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipui chuan Josua hnênah, “Pathian dangte rawng zawng kan bâwl hauh lo vang; Lalpa rawng a ni kan bâwl dâwn ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josua chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa rawngbâwl in thlang ngei a ni tih hretu chu nangmahni hi in ni e,” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Ni e, thuhretute kan ni e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josua chuan, “Chuti chu hnam dang pathian lim in kawlte kha paih bo rawh u le: Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chauh chu pawm rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipui chuan Josua chu an chhâng a, “Kan Pathian, Lalpa rawng chu kan bâwl ang a, a thu pawh kan zâwm zêl ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan Josua leh mipui chuan thu an thlung a; an zawm tûr dân leh thupêk a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josuan chûng chu Pathian dân bu-ah chuan a ziak lût a; lung lian tak a la a; Sekem khuaa Lalpa Hmun Thianghlim sasaw thing bulah chuan a phun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Josua chuan mipui hnênah, “En teh u, he lung hi kan thuhretu a ni; kan hnêna Lalpa thu sawi zawng zawng kha a hre vek a, in Pathian in kalsan loh nân in thuhretu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Josua chuan mipui chu a hawtîr a, mahni ram ṭheuhvah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan kum za leh sâwm a nihin Josua chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gaza tlâng hmâr lam, Efraim tlângrama ama chanpual Timat-sera-ah chuan an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Josua dam chhûng chuan Israel-te chuan Lalpa rawng an bâwl a, a thih hnuah pawh, anmahni mit ngeia Lalpa thiltih zawng zawng hmutute dam chhûng chu an bâwl zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Josefa ruang, Israel-ten Aigupta ram aṭanga an rawn lâk chhoh kha Sekem khuaah, Jakoban tangkaraw tlang zaa Sekema pa Hamora thlahte hnên aṭanga a leiah khân an phûm a. He ram hi Josefa thlahte khân an rochung zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Arona fapa, Eleazara pawh a thi a, Efraim-ho tlângrama awm, a fapa Finehasa puala an pêk ram Gibea khuaah an phûm a.
  </para>
</usx>
